fbf95d36-06d6-4eb8-b3bd-88aa5479f445	Quick Shower	10	0.3	2025-09-18 12:47:45.357882+00	1	\N	Heating water is energy-intensive. By reducing your shower to 3 minutes, you save water and the energy used to heat it. Multiply that by millions of showers, and it’s a massive cut in emissions.	If 1,000 people cut 5 minutes from showers today, that’s ~2 tons CO₂ saved — equal to 20,000 km of car travel avoided.	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/shower%20quick.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL3Nob3dlciBxdWljay5wbmciLCJpYXQiOjE3NTk5MDgyOTYsImV4cCI6MjA3NTI2ODI5Nn0.YepUjdZXsVtm0BaTHc-rKJXGuDrA0LvshecrV3ihizs	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/expanded/shower.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2V4cGFuZGVkL3Nob3dlci5wbmciLCJpYXQiOjE3NjAyMDIwNTMsImV4cCI6MjA3NTU2MjA1M30.OCiyxScblWXewl-BORQL_FmjR95c5hZIuGVnBjCMaXE	Excellent habit! Take a shower under 5 minutes. Tell us when done.	popup	5 min	Water Saved	Awesome! Short shower saved 50 litres of water and enough energy to power a light bulb for ~100 hours	Estimated: 3g CO₂ saved per shorter shower	\N	5000
5cda9085-6b46-4af3-a0e8-4b3401258348	Clean Your Inbox	5	0.003	2025-09-18 12:47:45.357882+00	\N	1	Every unread or unnecessary email takes up storage space on servers around the world. These servers need electricity to run and cool, which contributes to carbon emissions. By regularly clearing out your inbox, you are reducing digital clutter and cutting down on hidden energy waste. Plus, a tidy inbox makes it easier to focus and improves productivity.	If 1,000 people each delete 50 emails this week, that’s up to 10 kg of CO₂ saved — equivalent to running a ceiling fan for 100 hours.	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/clear%20email.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2NsZWFyIGVtYWlsLnBuZyIsImlhdCI6MTc1OTkwODIxMSwiZXhwIjoyMDc1MjY4MjExfQ.mYr4uq5u9t5P8D02rgdr4gDT2X1__4RgwhJUkQf1MEY	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/expanded/clear%20email.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2V4cGFuZGVkL2NsZWFyIGVtYWlsLnBuZyIsImlhdCI6MTc1OTIzMTc2MywiZXhwIjoyMDc0NTkxNzYzfQ.bv_Fn3nR36nUlTz8L7xPSLqGVMkD6ZP2JvvbAp9eH3E	Smart step! Delete emails with large attachments or 500 old emails. Tell us when done.	popup	15 min	Inbox Clean	Well done! You reduced digital carbon footprint — less storage energy = healthier planet!	Estimated: 1–3 g of CO₂ per email deleted	\N	0
ca8dfb06-5675-4389-a31f-9b328e026c5d	Screen Free Meal	10	0.003	2025-09-18 12:47:45.357882+00	2	\N	Eating without screens saves a little energy from devices but, more importantly, builds mindful habits and lowers screen dependency. Over time, reduced usage extends device life, cutting e-waste and future emissions.	If 1,000 people go screen-free at dinner daily, that’s ~250 kg CO₂ avoided monthly — equal to recycling 1,000 plastic bags.	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/screen%20free%20meal.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL3NjcmVlbiBmcmVlIG1lYWwucG5nIiwiaWF0IjoxNzU5OTA4MjQyLCJleHAiOjIwNzUyNjgyNDJ9.nn6SVPqZN3TCS9AqKZXpmTDpekccap1g3tb7Vs50-LA	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/expanded/screen%20free%20meal.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2V4cGFuZGVkL3NjcmVlbiBmcmVlIG1lYWwucG5nIiwiaWF0IjoxNzYwMjAyMDIwLCJleHAiOjIwNzU1NjIwMjB9.sAyts9VjVlUKeJnLZav25fJN7ijrQSYcBMTm3LqOr_s	Wonderful idea! Eat one full meal without screens. Tell us when you’re done eating mindfully	popup	30 min	Done Eating	Well done! You enjoyed a mindful meal and reduced digital energy use!	Estimated: Indirect — negligible CO₂, but reduces e-waste long-term	\N	1000
0c86d71f-eb62-4e2d-8dbd-e209cc423b6c	No Single use plastic	5	0.15	2025-09-18 12:47:45.357882+00	1	\N	Single-use plastics like bottles, straws, and cutlery are designed for a moment of convenience but have a long-lasting environmental impact. These plastics rarely get recycled and can take hundreds of years to decompose, polluting land, rivers, and oceans. By refusing single-use plastics today and opting for reusable alternatives, you help reduce greenhouse gas emissions from plastic production and disposal, protect wildlife, and cut down plastic pollution.	 If 1,000 people avoid single-use plastics today, that’s around 1,500 kg CO₂ saved — equivalent to preserving 75 trees or preventing nearly 1,000 plastic bottles from entering waste streams and waterways.	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/no%20single%20use%20plastic.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL25vIHNpbmdsZSB1c2UgcGxhc3RpYy5wbmciLCJpYXQiOjE3NTk5MDg5ODQsImV4cCI6MjA3NTI2ODk4NH0.kM_5ePfsHs7Qfn6k_bf8UqQYfl2boiWViF8F34rAx3g	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/expanded/no%20single%20use%20plastic.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2V4cGFuZGVkL25vIHNpbmdsZSB1c2UgcGxhc3RpYy5wbmciLCJpYXQiOjE3NTk5MDg4OTcsImV4cCI6MjA3NTI2ODg5N30.YzuZEzNoC7vHJakiqyl1_ClIPCvEeW0KF82UioXWM1Y	Smart choice! Say no to single-use plastic for all your meals and drinks today. Tell us when done.	popup	3 min	Plastic-Free	Fantastic! You prevented at least one plastic item from reaching the ocean or landfill today!	Estimated: Avoiding single-use plastic reduces about 1.5 kg CO₂ emissions per day	\N	0
bb099cdb-1e94-4fbc-8107-53114d3c8e01	Ditch the Ride, Walk Instead	5	0.09	2025-09-18 12:47:45.357882+00	1	\N	Short trips are often done by car, but they’re the least fuel-efficient. Choosing to walk instead saves fuel, cuts emissions, and boosts your health. Even a single kilometre adds up when many people choose the eco-route.	If 1,000 people skip 1 km car rides today, that’s 120 kg CO₂ saved — equal to planting 6 trees.	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/walking.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL3dhbGtpbmcucG5nIiwiaWF0IjoxNzU5OTA4MzQ0LCJleHAiOjIwNzUyNjgzNDR9.UTdvEwPYTyREzZsO2pglgvalbmZOLKj5E19Vb-9e1Cc	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/expanded/walking.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2V4cGFuZGVkL3dhbGtpbmcucG5nIiwiaWF0IjoxNzU5MjMxODkwLCJleHAiOjIwNzQ1OTE4OTB9.J8uNg94s1cBdGdHxN5mdDQUYubJQG5I4LydCpWQv5e4	Great start! Walk at least 1 km instead of driving today. Tell us when done	popup	30 min	Walk Completed	Awesome! You saved ~120g CO₂. One small step for you, a giant leap for the planet! 	Estimated: 120g CO₂ saved per 1 km not driven by car	\N	20000
d73fe084-e0ad-4b06-8340-6f3340329c7a	Unplug Appliances	10	0.5	2025-09-18 12:47:45.357882+00	1	\N	Even when switched off, many appliances draw “phantom power.” By unplugging devices like chargers, TVs, and microwaves, you cut wasted electricity. It’s a small act that compounds across households.	If 1,000 people unplug 3 devices daily, that’s ~150 kg CO₂ saved — equal to powering 60 homes’ lights for a day.	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/unplug%20appliances.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL3VucGx1ZyBhcHBsaWFuY2VzLnBuZyIsImlhdCI6MTc1OTkwODMxOSwiZXhwIjoyMDc1MjY4MzE5fQ.REJbMcaSxKwp3tPaYNBQmRTz9hBNFv4lJ1oLh6l8CZs	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/expanded/unplug%20appliances.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2V4cGFuZGVkL3VucGx1ZyBhcHBsaWFuY2VzLnBuZyIsImlhdCI6MTc1OTIzMTg3NCwiZXhwIjoyMDc0NTkxODc0fQ.I-XyYcelljU-pwIUsEeFodbhQQDwTX3Qqn7Ew0fa-Ro	Smart move! Unplug all the devices that are not in use. Tell us when done.	popup	3 min	Unplugged	Nice! You saved about 0.5 kWh of energy — that’s clean power for the planet!	 Estimated: 50 g CO₂ saved per device unplugged daily	\N	1000
