e7b8f314-7f8b-4d27-a2d1-03564884df20	Switch to E-Receipts	5	2.5	2025-11-19 09:28:25.155465+00	\N	1	Choose digital receipts instead of printed ones whenever you shop. Paper receipts may look\nsmall, but billions are printed every year, using paper, chemicals, and energy. Many receipts\nalso contain thermal paper, which cannot be recycled easily. Opting for an e-receipt reduces\nwaste, saves resources, and supports a shift toward cleaner, more efficient transactions.	If 1,000 people choose e-receipts today, that avoids the need for 1,000 printed slips, saving\npaper, reducing chemical waste, and preventing roughly 2.5 kg of CO2e in total emissions.	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/e%20rcpt.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2UgcmNwdC5wbmciLCJpYXQiOjE3NjU5NjM5NDAsImV4cCI6MjA4MTMyMzk0MH0.j4fvJ7FtkTtk8UmQKEqnHgo1OYn27ro0qjQtwAljquo	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/expanded/e%20rcpt.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2V4cGFuZGVkL2UgcmNwdC5wbmciLCJpYXQiOjE3NjM1NDQzMjgsImV4cCI6MjA3ODkwNDMyOH0.Yxko7DKpknmhadXth8qozP4MmEF0So_Oj9CuNqjSjUg	Smart choice!	popup	5 min	Switch Completed	Well done!	Estimated: Per person per receipt avoided ~2.5 g CO2e avoided	\N	50000
