6eb74ffa-7a62-40f8-8754-421907191e57	Segregate Dry, Wet, and Plastic Waste	10	\N	2025-11-19 16:03:37.044265+00	1	\N	Segregating waste at home makes recycling possible. When waste is separated correctly, more\nmaterial gets recycled, less goes to landfills, and plastic stays in the circular economy instead of\npolluting the environment.\n\nHow to segregate waste at home\n\n● Keep wet waste (food scraps) separate for composting\n● Keep dry waste like plastic, paper, and metal clean and dry\n● Store plastic separately—no sorting needed\n● Schedule a pickup on the app when you’re ready\n\nWhat happens next\n\nWe collect your plastic from your doorstep, weigh it, and pay you for the verified amount.	If 1,000 people segregate their waste correctly today, hundreds of kilograms of recyclables\n\ncan be recovered and diverted from landfills, while compostable waste can be turned into\nvaluable soil nutrients instead of generating methane in dumps.	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/waste%20segregation.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL3dhc3RlIHNlZ3JlZ2F0aW9uLnBuZyIsImlhdCI6MTc2NTk2NDEyMywiZXhwIjoyMDgxMzI0MTIzfQ.MIG8bQvUavdIh1oh4dGHPq3doGi5DkKdeZTzECoorcM	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/expanded/waste%20segregation.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2V4cGFuZGVkL3dhc3RlIHNlZ3JlZ2F0aW9uLnBuZyIsImlhdCI6MTc2MzU2ODAzMiwiZXhwIjoyMDc4OTI4MDMyfQ.G05IbG6jKnrloOI1B1Un9qXWBKplNLXEatl5gCDGQ6I	Excellent call!	popup	10 min	Waste Segregated!	Awesome!	Estimated: Proper segregation and recycling can prevent up to 60 kg of plastic per\nhousehold per year from ending up in landfills.	\N	100000
8b928be1-6caf-463b-a36a-e7d5197c805b	Compost Your Kitchen Waste	10	0.022	2025-11-19 08:49:37.450435+00	1	\N	Turn your daily food scraps into something valuable. Composting keeps kitchen waste out of\nlandfills, reduces methane emissions, and turns organic waste into nutrient-rich soil.\n\nHow to compost at home\n\n● Collect fruit peels, vegetable scraps, tea leaves, and coffee grounds\n● Add them to a compost bin or compostable bag daily\n● Keep the bin covered and slightly moist\n● Mix or turn occasionally to help it break down\n\nUse this compost for potted plants, balcony gardens, or any green space around your home.\n\nTip: Compost doesn’t smell if it’s balanced—avoid cooked or oily food, add some dry waste\n(paper, dry leaves), and keep the bin covered but ventilated.	If 1,000 people compost their kitchen waste today, that diverts 150 kg of organic waste,\navoiding approximately 5.6 kg of methane and ~158 kg of CO2e.	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/compost.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2NvbXBvc3QucG5nIiwiaWF0IjoxNzY1OTYzODY3LCJleHAiOjIwODEzMjM4Njd9.rv1aD00PrAt_lnIa9XhtFaElR6gkKVk5mtW69eEKHZg	https://hvgxicauyuchtqcdmdgp.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/sign/challenges/expanded/compost%20real.png?token=eyJraWQiOiJzdG9yYWdlLXVybC1zaWduaW5nLWtleV83NWE4MzYxYS1jODRhLTRlYjgtOWQ5ZS04MTYyM2VjOWIzMDIiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1cmwiOiJjaGFsbGVuZ2VzL2V4cGFuZGVkL2NvbXBvc3QgcmVhbC5wbmciLCJpYXQiOjE3NjgxMTEyNDcsImV4cCI6NjY3MzIyNzEyNDd9._9EU-DnLUTkDzPEqHxlUL8V6gP3nof8IC_m8NuF0MmA	Excellent call! 	popup	10 min	Waste Composed	Fantastic!	Estimated: Per household (4 people), ~0.022 kg of methane avoided daily and ~0.63 kg CO₂e avoided daily.	\N	20000
